<!--
  Strings for the settings home screen and for the shared settings widgets.

  Three groups live here: the root list of the settings app (its heading, the
  setup card and every row on it), the headings of the screens the navigation
  graph opens, and the few words the widgets every screen reuses have of their
  own.

  A row on the home list and the screen it opens carry the same name, so both
  read the same key. Do not split them.
-->
